就算要去看醫生 也是因為肚子這裡突出來

180
00:11:31,150 --> 00:11:32,380
That's a hernia.
那就是疝氣

181
00:11:32,650 --> 00:11:35,320
Why'd I have to start working out again?
我為什麼要恢復健身？

182
00:11:36,120 --> 00:11:37,890
Damn you, 15s!
爛啞鈴

183
00:11:40,260 --> 00:11:42,660
What the hell are you doing?
你在搞什麼？

184
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:44,820
Look,I was nervous.
我很緊張 

185
00:11:45,070 --> 00:11:47,900
You guys had me all worried I was gonna be boring.
你們害我擔心我會很無聊

186
00:11:48,100 --> 00:11:51,500
I got up there and they were all, like, staring at me.
我上了台，學生都盯著我看

187
00:11:51,740 --> 00:11:55,510
I opened my mouth and this British accent just came out.
結果我一開口就是英國腔了

188
00:11:56,340 --> 00:11:58,330
Yeah, and not a very good one.
而且還很矬

189
00:11:58,550 --> 00:12:00,410
Will you, please...?
別再說了

190
00:12:00,680 --> 00:12:02,510
Dr. Geller? Kurt Rathman.
蓋勒博士，寇特拉斯曼 

191
00:12:02,780 --> 00:12:05,270
I'm a paleontology professor here.
古生物學系教授

192
00:12:05,920 --> 00:12:08,410
Do you have a moment to talk about your lecture?
可以聊聊你的課嗎？

193
00:12:08,690 --> 00:12:11,450
I'm sorry, I've got plans with my sister.
抱歉，我和舍妹有約

194
00:12:11,730 --> 00:12:13,690
Monica Geller.
摩妮卡蓋勒

195
00:12:15,300 --> 00:12:18,600
Right. Will you excuse us for one moment?
是的，失陪一下

196
00:12:19,030 --> 00:12:21,760
-What are you doing? -You can have an accent, but I can't?
你幹什麼？ 你能裝我就不能裝？

197
00:12:22,400 --> 00:12:24,930
Top of the morning to you, laddies!
小伙子早啊

198
00:12:25,370 --> 00:12:27,860
Would you just please stop?
別鬧了

199
00:12:28,940 --> 00:12:33,140
Yes,yes,Bombay is very, very nice this time of year.
是的，這個季節的孟買 灰常怡人

200
00:12:49,900 --> 00:12:51,800
Hey, will you grab me a cruller?
幫我點個小煎餅

201
00:12:53,630 --> 00:12:54,760
Sit down!
坐下啦

202
00:12:55,900 --> 00:12:58,000
Will you go to the hospital?
我拜託你去看醫生

203
00:12:58,270 --> 00:12:59,970
Hernia operations cost...
大哥，疝氣手術…

204
00:13:00,240 --> 00:13:01,940
a lot probably,okay?
應該很貴

205
00:13:02,140 --> 00:13:06,740
Besides,it's getting darker and more painful. That means it's healing.
而且它越來越黑，越來越痛 就表示有在好

206
00:13:07,620 --> 00:13:09,450
Look, I'll loan you the money.
我借你錢

207
00:13:09,680 --> 00:13:13,020
Just go to the hospital and let's just get that thing...
趕快去醫院把它… 

208
00:13:13,320 --> 00:13:14,810
pushed back in.
塞回去

209
00:13:15,520 --> 00:13:18,650
Thank you, but it'd take me forever to pay you back.
謝謝，但我要很久才能還你 

210
00:13:18,930 --> 00:13:20,920
I don't want that hanging over my head.
我不想惦記這件事

211
00:13:21,130 --> 00:13:23,320
Besides,when my insurance kicks in...
而且只要健保恢復 

212
00:13:23,600 --> 00:13:26,460
I can get all the free operations I want.
我就可以動各種免費手術

213
00:13:26,770 --> 00:13:29,760
I'll probably start with that laser eye surgery.
我打算先去做眼睛雷射手術

214
00:13:33,870 --> 00:13:34,860
What's going on?
怎麼了？

215
00:13:35,140 --> 00:13:39,980
Joey's got a hernia, but it's nothing a little laser eye surgery won't fix.
喬伊的疝氣很嚴重 不過動個眼睛雷射手術就好了

216
00:13:40,950 --> 00:13:43,680
I'm telling you, if I put my hand on my stomach...
真的，把手壓在這裡...

217
00:13:43,950 --> 00:13:46,110
it doesn't hurt that bad.
就沒那麼痛

218
00:13:46,550 --> 00:13:48,320
Hey, maybe you'll die!
搞不好你會死

219
00:13:50,860 --> 00:13:52,720
Chandler, I'm scared.
錢德，我怕了

220
00:13:53,130 --> 00:13:54,720
No, we can go together.
我們可以一起走

221
00:13:54,960 --> 00:13:58,900
Just don't wait too long, because I'm out of here sometime before Friday.
但不要拖太久 我星期五之前就會掛掉

222
00:14:00,030 --> 00:14:01,560
But I don't want to die.
但是我不想死

223
00:14:01,870 --> 00:14:05,030
It'll be fun. We'll come back and haunt these guys!
不，會很好玩 我們可以回來嚇他們

224
00:14:06,670 --> 00:14:10,670
Wait. Could I come back and haunt Monica and Rachel when they're in the shower?
等等，我可以趁摩妮卡 和瑞秋洗澡時回來嗎？

225
00:14:11,950 --> 00:14:14,380
-That's my girlfriend. -Hey,I'm dead!
那是我的女朋友 我都死了

226
00:14:20,590 --> 00:14:22,780
-Give me them! -No, they are mine!
給我 不要，這是我的

227
00:14:23,020 --> 00:14:25,080
-You stole them from me! -You stole them from me!
是你偷我的 你才偷我的

228
00:14:25,290 --> 00:14:26,380
Give me them!
拿來

229
00:14:29,730 --> 00:14:31,060
Just wanna each take one?
要不要一人一個？

230
00:14:31,800 --> 00:14:34,290
Yeah, that seems fair. We never use them.
很公平，反正也沒用過

231
00:14:36,040 --> 00:14:39,100
Look, I really need some help, okay?
聽著，你們真的得幫我

232
00:14:39,370 --> 00:14:42,740
Why did I have to speak in a British accent?
為什麼我要說英國腔？

233
00:14:43,410 --> 00:14:44,400
What do I do?
我該怎麼辦？ 

234
00:14:44,580 --> 00:14:47,910
Why don't you call Mummy and Daddy?
去問爸爸媽媽呀

235
00:14:48,080 --> 00:14:52,110
I'm serious! Someone's gonna find out and then they're never gonna offer me a job.
我說真的，我遲早會被揭穿 教書的事就泡湯了

236
00:14:52,290 --> 00:14:54,410
Why don't you phase it out? Yeah, phase the accent out.
慢慢把口音改掉 

237
00:14:54,590 --> 00:14:57,920
People will think you're adjusting to life in America.
別人會以為你在適應美國生活

238
00:14:58,360 --> 00:15:00,350
Come on. No one will even notice.
是啊，根本不會有人注意 

239
00:15:00,560 --> 00:15:03,090
They're probably not even listening to you.
搞不好根本沒人在聽

240
00:15:05,130 --> 00:15:06,620
They're not listening to me?
沒人在聽我講話？ 

241
00:15:06,900 --> 00:15:09,460
Of course they're listening to you.
當然有人在聽

242
00:15:10,040 --> 00:15:11,440
Everybody listens to you.
每個人都在聽你講話

243
00:15:12,040 --> 00:15:15,240
Monica,do you think I should try this phasing-out thing?
你真的覺得我慢慢改嗎？

244
00:15:15,540 --> 00:15:17,030
I think you look fine.
我覺得你很帥啊

245
00:15:21,080 --> 00:15:22,640
Whenever you're ready.
好了就開始 好

246
00:15:24,620 --> 00:15:25,920
Hey,Timmy.
提米

247
00:15:27,090 --> 00:15:29,560
I've got a surprise...
我有個驚喜...

248
00:15:29,790 --> 00:15:30,920
for you.
給你

249
00:15:31,460 --> 00:15:32,480
Hold it. I'm sorry.
停，抱歉 

250
00:15:32,890 --> 00:15:36,830
The surprise is a new swing set. If you could play it less intense.
這個驚喜是一組新鞦韆 別演得這麼凝重

252
00:15:37,060 --> 00:15:38,960
Oh,yeah. Sure, no problem.
好，沒問題

253
00:15:39,230 --> 00:15:41,060
Just hold on one second.
等我一下

254
00:15:47,840 --> 00:15:49,830
Hey,Timmy.
提米

255
00:15:50,080 --> 00:15:53,340
I've got a surprise for you!
我要給你一個驚喜

256
00:15:53,610 --> 00:15:54,600
Oh, my God!
天哪

257
00:16:00,920 --> 00:16:04,150
So that's why I feed my dog Purina One.
所以我都餵我的狗吃跑路 

258
00:16:04,830 --> 00:16:06,490
Pick up a bag today.
今天就去搬一包吧

259
00:16:08,430 --> 00:16:10,990
-That's where you pick up the bag. -Exactly.
這時候你要把它搬起來 沒錯

260
00:16:12,170 --> 00:16:16,130
The line is, "Pick up a bag," so you need to pick up the bag.
不是，台詞是搬一包 所以你得把它搬起來

261
00:16:16,340 --> 00:16:19,360
Or I could just point to it.
或是用指的

262
00:16:20,710 --> 00:16:24,670
Purina One. Point to a bag today.
嘰哩呱哇  今天就去指一包吧

263
00:16:28,850 --> 00:16:29,920
I didn't get it, did I?
我沒過，對吧？

264
00:16:30,059 --> 00:16:31,217
-No. -Yeah.
沒有 好

266
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:38,190
Joey Tribbiani.
你好，我是喬伊崔比亞尼

267
00:16:38,460 --> 00:16:40,720
I'm here to audition for "Man."
我來應徵…的人

268
00:16:42,030 --> 00:16:43,160
You mean "Dying Man."
垂死的人嗎？ 沒錯

269
00:16:47,740 --> 00:16:50,860
-Do it one more time. -Really? Really? Okay.
快，再打一次 真的要打？好

270
00:16:54,510 --> 00:16:59,040
Hello, Ross? This is Dr. McNeely from the Fake Accent University.
羅斯你好 我是假口音大學的麥尼利博士

271
00:16:59,310 --> 00:17:01,710
We'd like you to come onboard full-time!
我們想聘你當專任教授

272
00:17:07,220 --> 00:17:08,520
Listen to this!
聽我說 

273
00:17:09,190 --> 00:17:11,320
My reading was wrong. I'm not going to die.
預言錯了，我不會死了

274
00:17:11,560 --> 00:17:12,860
Really? How do you know?
真的？你怎麼知道？ 

275
00:17:13,090 --> 00:17:14,530
My psychic is dead!
因為我的靈媒死了

276
00:17:16,760 --> 00:17:18,730
She must have read the cards wrong.
她一定是看錯牌了

277
00:17:19,000 --> 00:17:20,520
I'm sorry.
我很遺憾 

278
00:17:20,730 --> 00:17:22,430
Better her than me.
總比我死好

279
00:17:23,040 --> 00:17:25,010
Hey,let's bake cookies!
我們來烤餅乾

280
00:17:30,780 --> 00:17:33,080
Listen, I'm really glad you got the part.
恭喜你拿到這個角色 

281
00:17:34,920 --> 00:17:36,680
Are you sure you can do this?
你真的能演嗎？ 

282
00:17:37,250 --> 00:17:39,080
And thanks for coming with me.
謝謝你陪我來 

283
00:17:39,350 --> 00:17:42,250
And thanks again for helping me take a shower.
還有謝謝你幫我洗澡

284
00:17:44,560 --> 00:17:47,960
Now,is that "never talking about it again"?
這樣叫絕口不提嗎？

285
00:17:50,130 --> 00:17:51,720
We're ready for you.
喬伊，都準備好了

286
00:17:52,470 --> 00:17:55,060
This is Alex. He'll be playing your son.
這是亞歷，他演你的兒子 

287
00:17:55,300 --> 00:17:56,390
Hi,Alex.
你好

288
00:17:56,600 --> 00:17:59,600
As you can see,my hands are not in my pants.
我的手可沒塞在褲子裡

289
00:18:01,847 --> 00:18:02,905
好

290
00:18:04,380 --> 00:18:07,440
All right, Alex. Now, when Joey says his line...
亞歷克斯，當喬伊說到 

291
00:18:07,750 --> 00:18:11,380
"Take good care of your mama, son," that's your cue to cry. Got it?
「好好照顧你媽媽」 你就要哭，懂嗎？

293
00:18:11,650 --> 00:18:13,090
All right, let's do this.
好，來吧

294
00:18:17,420 --> 00:18:19,620
Scene five, take one.
第五場，第一次

295
00:18:21,160 --> 00:18:22,420
And action!
開始

296
00:18:22,630 --> 00:18:24,890
Take good care of your mama, son.
兒子，好好照顧你媽媽

297
00:18:33,110 --> 00:18:35,270
Take good care of your mama, son.
兒子，好好照顧你媽媽

298
00:18:39,180 --> 00:18:40,310
Come on, son.
拜託啦

299
00:18:40,810 --> 00:18:42,980
Your mama's good people.
你媽是個好人

300
00:18:43,850 --> 00:18:47,790
Cut! Alex, remember, you're supposed to cry.
停！ 亞歷克斯，這裡應該要哭 

301
00:18:48,020 --> 00:18:50,150
Can you cry for us this time?
你這次可以哭嗎？

302
00:18:50,660 --> 00:18:52,630
All right. From the top.
好吧 好，重來

303
00:18:55,330 --> 00:18:57,760
Scene five, take two.
第五場，第二次

304
00:18:58,530 --> 00:19:00,300
Take 36 is up.
第卅六次要來了

305
00:19:01,370 --> 00:19:03,030
Let's try this again.
再來一次

306
00:19:03,370 --> 00:19:04,530
You ready,Joe?
喬伊，你好了嗎？

307
00:19:04,770 --> 00:19:07,470
One thing, is it all right if I scream...
請問一下，你喊開始前 

308
00:19:07,670 --> 00:19:09,610
right up until you say, "Action"?
我可以大叫嗎？

309
00:19:10,480 --> 00:19:11,940
Sure.
可以

310
00:19:14,010 --> 00:19:17,110
-Action! -Take good care of your mama,son.
開始 兒子，好好照顧你媽媽

311
00:19:19,850 --> 00:19:20,980
Cut!
卡

312
00:19:22,160 --> 00:19:26,530
I'm sorry. Why don't you lift up your shirt? Take a look at this, kiddo.
抱歉…喬伊，你把衣服掀開來 小鬼你看

313
00:19:30,660 --> 00:19:34,000
We have a crying child! Roll the damn cameras!
有小孩哭了，攝影機快拍

314
00:19:40,670 --> 00:19:43,170
-Hello, is Ross there? -No,he's not. Can I take a message?
羅斯在嗎？ 他不在，你要留言嗎？

315
00:19:43,410 --> 00:19:45,880
Yes, this is Russell, Ross' divorce lawyer.
好，我是羅斯的離婚律師

316
00:19:46,150 --> 00:19:50,520
Since I haven't heard from him, I assume he's giving the marriage a try.
我想一直沒有他的回音 他應該是想試著經營這段婚姻

317
00:19:51,050 --> 00:19:52,580
Ross got married again?
羅斯又結婚了？

318
00:19:56,520 --> 00:19:59,820
All right, keep going. We are phasing the accent out.
繼續，慢慢改掉口音

319
00:20:00,060 --> 00:20:01,690
Phasing it out.
慢慢改掉

320
00:20:02,430 --> 00:20:06,830
"So without retesting their results in the laboratory...
要不是進實驗室重新化驗結果

321
00:20:07,400 --> 00:20:10,560
the team would never have identified...
研究小組也不會發現

322
00:20:13,240 --> 00:20:17,230
the initial errors in their carbon dating...
原先的碳14定年結果...

323
00:20:17,510 --> 00:20:19,070
analysis."
有誤

324
00:20:21,350 --> 00:20:23,370
Were there any questions at this point?
到這裡有問題嗎？

325
00:20:25,290 --> 00:20:27,250
What's happening to your accent?
請說 你的口音怎麼沒了？

326
00:20:30,060 --> 00:20:33,030
Come again? What's this nonsense?
再說一次，你說什麼？

327
00:20:37,100 --> 00:20:39,860
All right. I'm not English.
好吧，我不是英國人 

328
00:20:41,470 --> 00:20:43,400
I'm from Long lsland.
我是長島人

329
00:20:44,300 --> 00:20:47,360
I was really nervous, and the accent...
我一緊張就... 

330
00:20:47,570 --> 00:20:49,130
just came out.
冒出那個腔調了

331
00:20:49,610 --> 00:20:51,100
I'm sorry.
很抱歉

332
00:20:52,950 --> 00:20:55,920
So if we could just get back to the lecture.
回到課堂上來

333
00:20:58,250 --> 00:20:59,910
Were there any questions?
有任何問題嗎？

334
00:21:02,590 --> 00:21:04,220
About paleontology?
古生物學的問題

335
00:21:07,630 --> 00:21:10,290
I was just trying to make a good first impression.
我只是想留下良好的第一印象 

336
00:21:10,560 --> 00:21:14,730
Obviously, I screwed up. But what you guys think of me is important...
但我顯然搞砸了 但你們對我的看法很重要 

338
00:21:14,970 --> 00:21:17,990
because I'm hoping to get a permanent job here.
因為我想成為專任教授

339
00:21:18,270 --> 00:21:22,470
So if you'd just give me another chance to make a good impression..
如果你們肯再給我一次機會 製造好感…

340
00:21:23,180 --> 00:21:25,300
Ross! Are you crazy?
羅斯！你瘋了嗎？ 

341
00:21:25,580 --> 00:21:28,670
I am still your wife? Were you just never gonna tell me?
我還是你的老婆？ 你想瞞我一輩子嗎？ 

343
00:21:28,950 --> 00:21:31,180
What the hell is wrong with you?
你是哪裡有病？

344
00:21:31,450 --> 00:21:33,510
I could just kill you!
我真想宰了你

345
00:21:38,930 --> 00:21:40,620
Well, hello, Rachel!
瑞秋你好

346
00:21:49,100 --> 00:21:51,230
You've really done this before?
你真的玩過？ 

347
00:21:51,940 --> 00:21:54,530
You just take a big, big swing,okay?
你就用力K下去

348
00:21:54,780 --> 00:21:56,570
Now, don't hold back.
不要手軟 

349
00:22:01,550 --> 00:22:02,540
What are you doing?
你們在幹嘛？ 

350
00:22:02,850 --> 00:22:06,380
We're just celebrating that Joey got his health insurance back.
慶祝喬伊的健保恢復

351
00:22:07,250 --> 00:22:08,240
Oh, all right.
好

352
00:22:14,660 --> 00:22:16,960
See? Now let's try one without the helmet.
看吧，脫掉頭盔再來一次

353
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


354
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
